&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Promote Databricks enterprise cloud data platform powered by Apache Spark&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Be Customer focused by delivering technical and business results using the Databricks Platform&lt;/li&gt;
