&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;SLSQ327R442&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Consulting &amp;amp; Systems Integrator (C&amp;amp;SI) team accelerates Databricks&#39; growth by building and managing relationships with the leading data technology services companies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, as our Global Accenture Lead, you will drive a high-performing partnership focused on the strategic go-to-market motions with the Accenture Databricks Business Group (ADBG) to accelerate the business and manage a global team. You will lead this global partnership and implement a cohesive strategy to grow an iconic partnership focused on expanding mindshare, growing revenue, scaling the newly formed ADBG, and driving joint innovation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will report to the Vice President of System Integrator Partners&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2006&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;The impact you will have: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will manage a team of global alliance professionals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will expand and develop a partnership focused on delivering predictable and recurring growth within a mutually defined plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will engage the C-Suite at Accenture to build out the Global Strategy and Business Plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will help accelerate Databricks&#39; and the partner&#39;s adoption within new opportunities and use case expansion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will develop a training strategy resulting in practice growth and knowledge expansion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will secure investment and establish programs around repeatable IP and solution investments, resulting in essential go-to-market plans&lt;/li&gt;
