&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BS (or higher) in Computer Science, or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of production level experience in one of: Java, Scala, Golang, C++, or similar language&lt;/li&gt;
