&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3156&quot;&gt;Form successful relationships with clients throughout your assigned territory to provide technical and business value in collaboration with an Account Executive and a Senior Solutions Architect.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3354&quot;&gt;Gain excitement from clients about Databricks through hands-on evaluation and Spark programming, integrating with the wider cloud ecosystem and 3rd party applications.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3525&quot;&gt;Contribute to building the Databricks technical community through engagement at workshops, seminars, and meet-ups.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3643&quot;&gt;Become a Big Data Analytics advisor on aspects of architecture and design.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3721&quot;&gt;Support your customers by authoring reference architectures, how-tos, and demo applications.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3817&quot;&gt;Develop both technically and in the pre-sales aspect with the goal of becoming an independently operating Solutions Architect.&lt;/p&gt;
