&lt;li&gt;Strong programming skills in &lt;strong&gt;Scala, Go, or Python&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with distributed systems, scalable APIs, or cloud-native infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
