&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot;&gt;Dual-headquartered in Munich and Berlin, this powerhouse employs nearly 300,000 people across a vast multi-divisional ecosystem. You will navigate a complex landscape that spans Healthcare, Energy infrastructure, Mobility, and Smart Buildings, driving digital transformation for a national treasure that remains a global benchmark for engineering excellence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;8&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;The impact you&#39;ll have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
